                                "sense_id": "69873769-a354-3b98-bb8a-f44a78866d86",
                                "text": "Zijn voetafdruk was duidelijk zichtbaar in de verse sneeuw.",
                                "translation": "His footprint was clearly visible in the fresh snow.",
